  "reasoning": "The facts show that the public unit (教研中心) received a 10% rebate from the book company, which is a bribe, and the director Yue personally directed the money to an off‑book petty cash for improper use. This constitutes the crime of accepting bribes (受贿) for both the unit and the individual. Additionally, Yue was found to have driven while intoxicated, which is a violation of traffic safety law and constitutes dangerous driving (危险驾驶). According to the correction rules, we list the crime names without the suffix “罪”. Therefore the appropriate charges are 受贿 and 危险驾驶.",
